[217244] = {name = "Pattern: Crimson Silk Robe", additional_info = "Requires Tailoring (205)\n\n[q2]Use: Teaches you how to sew a Crimson Silk Robe.\nSell Price: \n[q2]Crimson Silk Robe\nBinds when equipped\n{Chest} {Cloth}\n54 Armor\n+15 Intellect\nDurability 70 / 70\nRequires Level 36\n[q2]Equip: Increases damage done by Fire spells and effects by up to 9.\nSell Price: \nRequires Bolt of Silk Cloth (8), Elemental Fire (4), Mana Potion (2), Red Dye (4), Silken Thread"},
