[239547] = {name = "[q4]Duskwraith Wristguards", additional_info = "Sanctified\nBinds when picked up\n{Wrist} {Leather}\n120 Armor\n+6 Strength\n+14 Agility\n+23 Stamina\nDurability 40 / 40\nClasses: Rogue\nRequires Level 60\n[q2]Equip: Reduces the chance for your attacks to be dodged or parried by 1%.\n\n[q2]Equip: Improves your chance to hit with all spells and attacks by 1%.\n\n[q2]Equip: Increased Defense +11.\n\n[q]Duskwraith Leathers (0/8)\n[q0]Duskwraith Mask\nDuskwraith Mantle\nDuskwraith Chestguard\nDuskwraith Belt\nDuskwraith Leggings\nDuskwraith Treads\nDuskwraith Wristguards\nDuskwraith Grips\n[q0](2) Set : Your stacks of Rolling with the Punches also increase all damage you deal by 1%.\n(4) Set : Your Blade Flurry now also strikes a third target and increases your attack speed by an additional 10%. In addition, each combo point you spend reduces the remaining cooldown on your Blade Flurry by 0.5 sec.\n(6) Set : Your Rolling with the Punches now grants 2% more health and 1% more damage per stack. At 5 stacks, each time you Dodge or Parry you will gain 10 Energy. (1s cooldown)\nSell Price:"},
