[240052] = {name = "[q4]Fireleaf Bindings", additional_info = "Sanctified\nBinds when picked up\n{Wrist} {Cloth}\n64 Armor\n+13 Stamina\n+16 Intellect\nDurability 35 / 35\nClasses: Mage\nRequires Level 60\n[q2]Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike with all spells and attacks by 1%.\n\n[q2]Equip: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 35.\n\n[q]Fireleaf Regalia (0/8)\n[q0]Fireleaf Circlet\nFireleaf Shoulderpads\nFireleaf Belt\nFireleaf Leggings\nFireleaf Sandals\nFireleaf Bindings\nFireleaf Gloves\nFireleaf Robe\n[q0](2) Set : Your Living Bomb now deals damage every 1 sec, and will detonate if the target dies. In addition, the effect of Glaciate from the rune of Ice Lance now stacks up to 10 times, and Spellfrost Bolt grants 2 stacks each time it hits.\n(4) Set : Casting Deep Freeze increases the remaining duration of your Icy Veins spell by 10 sec. Casting Pyroblast cancels 2 stacks of the effect from your Balefire Bolt.\n(6) Set : Reduces the cooldown on your Frozen Orb spell by 25 sec. Each time Glaciate is consumed, the cooldown on your Deep Freeze is reduced by 1.0 sec per stack consumed. Reduces the cooldown on Fire Blast by 5 sec and Fire Blast now refreshes the duration of your Living Bomb on the target.\nSell Price:"},
