[240109] = {name = "[q4]Soulcrusher Embrace", additional_info = "Sanctified\nBinds when picked up\n{Chest} {Mail}\n611 Armor\n+17 Stamina\n+45 Intellect\nDurability 140 / 140\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 60\n[q2]Equip: Improves your chance to hit with all spells and attacks by 1%.\n\n[q2]Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike with all spells and attacks by 1%.\n\n[q2]Equip: Increases your casting speed by 3%.\n\n[q2]Equip: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 22.\n\n[q]The Soulcrusher's Storm (0/8)\n[q0]Soulcrusher Crown\nSoulcrusher Mantle\nSoulcrusher Embrace\nSoulcrusher Cord\nSoulcrusher Kilt\nSoulcrusher Greaves\nSoulcrusher Bindings\nSoulcrusher Mitts\n[q0](2) Set : When your Lava Burst, Chain Lightning, or Lightning Bolt strikes a target afflicted with your Flame Shock Rank 5 or Rank 6, it also deals one pulse of Flame Shock's damage.\n(4) Set : Chance to trigger Overload increased by an additional 10% and Lava Bursts damage is increased by a percentage equal to your spell critical strike chance. When Lightning Bolt or Chain Lightning deal damage, increase the damage dealt by your next Lava Burst cast within 15 sec by 10%, stacking up to 5 times.\n(6) Set : When your Chain Lightning damages fewer than 3 targets, it deals 35% increased damage for each target less than 3.\nSell Price:"},
